* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_ctrn (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): demo12_capcom plus the
* capacity transfer of decommissioning flows (coef_shp.mod L77-94; M1.3 change 59): with
* FLO_FUNCX(R,'0',P,'CAPFLO',C) = 3 and a capacity shape NCAP_CPX, the decommissioning flows
* NCAP_OCOM of the gas plant ELCTNGAS01 follow the decline of its capacity over its life, instead of
* coming at its end:
* - capacity shape 3 (SHAPE: from 1 at age 1 down to 0.6 at age 50, a value at every age) on
*   ELCTNGAS01 in both regions, for every vintage (NCAP_CPX is not interpolated), which also
*   rescales its COEF_CPT (coef_shp.mod L55-73);
* - the transfer on its ELCCO2 in REG1 (with early retirement and RCAP_OCAP from demo12_capcom, so
*   COEF_RCOM too) and in REG2 (NCAP_OCOM 0.2, no early retirement).
